{{Top}}
'''Corina Flloyd''' was one of the guests invited to an upcoming dinner for the governor of [[Hanna City|Hanna]], hosted by [[Senator]] [[Mon Mothma]] and her husband [[Perrin Fertha]].<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The character's name is similar to that of [[Corina Floyd]], who worked as a senior production buyer on ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="Kassa">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref> and as an assistant art director on the [[2019]] film {{Film|9}}.<ref name="Star Wars: Episode IX The Rise of Skywalker">{{Film|IX}}</ref>

